00:04:21,000 --> 00:04:27,000
Believe Me: The Abduction of Lisa McVey is a drama, tv
movie, crime film directed by Jim Donovan.

2
00:08:42,000 --> 00:08:48,000
On the night she plans on taking her own life, 17-year-old 'Lisa McVey' is
kidnapped and finds herself fighting to stay alive and is raped.

3
00:13:03,000 --> 00:13:09,000
She manages to talk her attacker into releasing her, but when she returns home, no one believes her
story except for one detective, who suspects she was abducted by a serial killer.

4
00:17:24,000 --> 00:17:30,000
Based on horrifying true events.

5
00:21:45,000 --> 00:21:51,000
Lisa McVey, played by Katie Douglas.

6
00:26:06,000 --> 00:26:12,000
Sgt. Larry Pinkerton, played by David James Elliott.

7
00:30:27,000 --> 00:30:33,000
Bobby Joe Long, played by Rossif Sutherland.

8
00:34:48,000 --> 00:34:54,000
Lorrie, played by Amanda Arcuri.

9
00:39:09,000 --> 00:39:15,000
